  "details": "This is an SDK request to allow creators to specifically mark parts on avatars to be either Quest Specific, PC Specific or cross platform. Using a \"Control Panel\" you can Identify and Flag avatar bits and pieces that will Show and Hide when switching version In editor as well as in publishing. This can also extend to the Radial menu as some avatars may have Music on them, I've had my fair share of Quest folk pressing music buttons and wondering where it is so I thought It would be nice to auto-hide that menu for Quest using this system.",
